

//HELM OF INFRAVISION - 1500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/HELM05.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY DESC "This class of decorative helmet, made of reinforced leather or metal, covers the face and head. Eye slits and breathing holes come highly recommended.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Helm of Infravision"
	SAY DESC "Being a scavenger of a sort, Babette Maelestrom had this helm created to aid her in her dungeon excursions. She would later attribute her gathered wealth solely to its power, though likely it was as much her keen eyes as anything.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- +1 THAC0
– Infravision up to 120 ft.
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"




//HELM OF HORNS - solo guerrieri - 1500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/TB#HEHO.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY DESC "This class of decorative helmet, made of reinforced leather or metal, covers the face and head. Eye slits and breathing holes come highly recommended. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Helm of Horns"
	SAY DESC "This simple iron helmet is lined with jagged, protruding spikes. While crudely made, it is enchanted with a minor retaliatory charm. Whenever the wearer is struck, there is a chance that the helmet’s spikes will magically lengthen or lash out, punishing the attacker for their aggression.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Combat abilities:
- 15% chance every hit to deal 3 Piercing Damage to attacker

Weight: 3"




//HELM OF DEFENSE - 5000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/HELM04.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY DESC "This class of open-face helmet, made of reinforced leather or metal, covers most of the head save the face and neck. These helmets commonly provide protection for the nose. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Helm of Defense"
	SAY DESC "This iron helm has a rough, spiked texture, giving it a formidable and jagged silhouette. Despite its harsh exterior, the helm's interior is lined with masterfully crafted padding that adjusts to the wearer's head as if it were custom-made. More than a simple piece of armor, the helm is imbued with powerful enchantments that extend protection far beyond the brow, shielding the wearer's entire form from harm.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +1
– Slashing Damage Resistance: +5%
– Piercing Damage Resistance: +5%
– Missile Damage Resistance: +5%
– Crushing Damage Resistance: +5%
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 3"




//HELM OF GLORY - 3500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/HELM03.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY DESC "This class of open-face helmet, made of reinforced leather or metal, covers most of the head save the face and neck. These helmets commonly provide protection for the nose. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Helm of Glory"
	SAY DESC "Named for its original owner, Sir Tain the Noble, this helm saw many great battles in his possession. It was eventually passed on to Sir Tain's squire, who had served him faithfully for almost ten years. Alas, the young man had neither the strength, nor the skill to uphold his master's legacy. It is rumored he lost his life in the pursuit of a worthy, but ultimately futile cause, and the helm has had many owners since. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: +1
– Charisma: +1
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"




