//KIEL'S HELMET - 4000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/HELM14.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helm"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "The sturdy, steel-banded helm is dented and scarred from heavy use. Dwarven runes are set into the metal above the brow.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Kiel's Helmet"
	SAY DESC "This is the helmet worn by Kiel the Legion Killer, firstborn son of Durlag Trollkiller and Clan-prince of his father's ill-fated tower. It is said that anyone who wears it is granted immunity to all forms of fear and panic, be their origins natural or magical.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against all forms of panic and boosts morale
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2
"




//THE GUARDIAN DEVIL - no good - solo guerrieri - valore 5000mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/BDHELM04.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "This class of decorative helmet, made of reinforced leather or metal, covers the face and head. Eye slits and breathing holes come highly recommended. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "The Guardian Devil"
	SAY DESC "This dark, obsidian-wrought helmet feels unnaturally warm to the touch, and faint, guttural whispers can be heard emanating from within the visor. It is said that a minor Tanar'ri was bound into the metal by a desperate warlock who sought protection at any cost. The demon within does not serve out of loyalty, but out of a perverse desire to keep its 'host' alive just to witness more suffering. When the wearer is struck in combat, the entity's rage flares, briefly lashing out to reinforce the wearer's physical form with abyssal energy.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Magic Resistance: +5%
– Protects against critical hits

Combat abilities:
- 20% chance every hit to receive +2 Melee THAC0 and Damage bonus for 6 seconds 

Weight: 2"







//MIRROR HELM - valore 6500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/TB#HEMI.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "This class of decorative helmet, made of reinforced leather or metal, covers the face and head. Eye slits and breathing holes come highly recommended. 

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits

Weight: 2"

	SAY NAME2 "Mirror Helm"
	SAY DESC "This magnificent helmet is crafted from a polished, silvery alloy that shines with a brilliance bordering on the supernatural. Its surface is so flawlessly reflective that it acts as a perfect mirror, catching the light and casting shimmering patterns upon the surroundings. Legends whisper that the helm was cooled in the waters of a moonlit lake and tempered with the essence of a Gaze Reflection spell, granting its wearer a defense that few mages or monsters can bypass.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects from all gaze-based attacks

Weight: 2"








//DRAGON HELM - valore 6000mo//
