	SAY NAME2 "Dragon Helm"
	SAY DESC "The skillful hand of the warlock Wormsor carefully worked a base of red dragon scales to forge this powerful helmet, integrating it with scales of the other colors. The overlapping red, white, blue, black, and green scales protect the wearer from normal blows as well as fire, cold, electricity, acid, and poison. It is hard to determine whether the benefits originate within the scales or the spells of the mage.
	
