	SAY NAME1 "Helmet"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "This headpiece is of an atypical and bizarre design, crudely fashioned from the massive, spiraled horn of an unknown beast. Its appearance is unsettling and primitive, far removed from standard smithing. Despite its strange, organic origin, the helm feels nearly indestructible to the touch. 

