	SAY DESC "Crafted from the severed horn of a colossal, prehistoric beast, this helm retains the primordial resilience of the creature from which it was taken. The thick, calcified layers have been hollowed out and reinforced with steel rivets, turning a trophy of the hunt into a formidable piece of protection. Its natural density is so great that it effortlessly absorbs the impact of blunt trauma, turning aside heavy maces and war hammers that would shatter ordinary iron.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protects against critical hits
– Armor Class vs. Crushing: +4

Weight: 3"









