	SAY DESC "This ancient crown, carved from the deep bedrock of the Tethir Mountains, is a relic of the legendary giant-slayers of old. Imbued with the primal weight of the earth itself, the helm anchors the wearer’s mind and body against the most jarring assaults. Those who wear it claim to feel as immovable as a mountain; no blow, however thunderous, can rattle their resolve or cloud their senses.

