	SAY DESC "Whispered only In Tenebris by the most depraved cultists, the true origin of this obsidian helm is written within Nekron's Bloody Rhymes. Chroniclers speak of its forging during the ancient Aeons of Raging Darkness, when the sky opened to unleash the Rain of a Thousand Flames, an apocalyptic event that marked the beginning of the Dark Reign of Fire. As the artifact was quenched in the blood of innocents, an Unholy Warcry echoed across the planes, summoning the Gargoyles, Angels of Darkness from their eternal slumber. They marched forth from the Bloody Red Dungeons of Dar-Kunor to subjugate the mortal realms under a ruthless Reign of Terror. This horrific crown was created to fulfill The Mystic Prophecy of the Demonknight, ensuring that all creation would plunge blindly From Chaos to Eternity. 
	
